fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heavy–light decomposition of a rooted tree or arborescence: each vertex’s heavy child is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its child with the largest subtree (the first in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order on a tie), and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"heavy edges form paths. Vertices get positions in a preorder that takes the heavy child first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so each heavy path and each subtree is an interval of positions, and any path between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"segments(from:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/HeavyLightDecomposition/Preorder-swift.struct/max(count:)-26kmf":{"url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition\/preorder-swift.struct\/max(count:)-26kmf","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Comparable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"max","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"type